#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:549
msgid "Pick which features your community uses. Core features always run."
msgstr ""
"Kies welke functies je community gebruikt. Kernfuncties worden altijd "
"uitgevoerd."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:550
msgid "Control who can sign up and how new accounts are verified."
msgstr "Bepaal wie zich kan aanmelden en hoe nieuwe accounts worden geverifieerd."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:551
msgid "Follow, connect, and block: the relationships that drive the feed."
msgstr "Volgen, verbinden en blokkeren: de relaties die de feed aansturen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:552
