msgstr "Toegestane e-maildomeinen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2005
msgid "One domain per line. When set, only these domains can register."
msgstr ""
"Eén domein per regel. Wanneer ingesteld, kunnen alleen deze domeinen zich "
"registreren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2013 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2945
