#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-danger.php:291
msgid "Archive space"
msgstr "Ruimte archiveren"

#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-danger.php:126
msgid ""
"Make the space read-only. Members can still view posts but new activity is "
"disabled. You can restore it later."
msgstr ""
"Zet de ruimte op alleen-lezen. Leden kunnen berichten nog wel bekijken, "
"maar nieuwe activiteit is uitgeschakeld. Je kunt de ruimte later herstellen."

